  "title": "TileQuant and TriAttention: Unified Precision Units for LLMs",
  "summary": "TileQuant introduces a training-free framework for mixed-precision post-training quantization, assigning precision to hardware-aligned 2D weight tiles to preserve quality while reducing deployment costs. TriAttention enables efficient attention computation by using sparse mixed-precision with dynamic query-key precision, achieving significant improvements in inference speed and maintaining model performance.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "TileQuant assigns precision to hardware-aligned 2D weight tiles to preserve quality and reduce deployment costs.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "TriAttention uses dynamic query-key precision to balance sparsity and precision, achieving end-to-end speedups of up to 7.88x over the BF16 baseline.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Both frameworks are designed to maintain quality while enabling efficient hardware execution.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
